  - m_Id: 13550985666560
    m_Localized: Set up AprilTags
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198935174963200
    m_Localized: Measure size
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198935179157504
    m_Localized: Cancel measurement
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198935179157505
    m_Localized: Place the controller dot at a corner of the tag's inner white square
      and press the trigger. Back cancels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198935179157506
    m_Localized: Place the dot at the adjacent corner of the same edge and press
      the trigger to apply its length. Back restarts.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198935179157507
    m_Localized: The tag edge must be at least 1 cm. Select an adjacent corner, or
      press Back to restart.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198935179157508
    m_Localized: '{0:0.0} cm'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 533178702104363357
  - m_Id: 281266782986240
    m_Localized: This map already has alignment references. Align to them before
      adding a new reference. If this device cannot recover them, open the map on
      a headset that can.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 281266782986241
    m_Localized: Set up a reference for the selected alignment method while aligned
      to this map, then switch methods.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 291267517865984
    m_Localized: System determined
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 291267517865985
    m_Localized: Uses the system's origin with no game alignment offset. Each device's
      system must provide the same shared origin.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 367666723282944
    m_Localized: System determined remains active. Register the first AprilTag on
      a headset to finish switching to AprilTags, or select System determined to
      cancel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 569645063987200
    m_Localized: Two AprilTags
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 569645068181504
    m_Localized: Scan two different AprilTags on each headset. The lower ID is the
      origin; the higher ID sets forward, with gravity defining up. Keep them at
      least 10 cm apart horizontally. No registration is needed. If more IDs are
      seen, the two lowest are used; show the same pair to every headset.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 577596147359744
    m_Localized: Waiting for a ready headset to create and share anchors.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 577596151554048
    m_Localized: 'Anchor minter: headset {0}.'
    m_Metadata:
